# Building Regression Models

Lesson 5 opens with "Predict the Price": a ride-share service charges &#36;11 for 4 miles, &#36;15 for 6 miles, &#36;19 for 8 miles.

***Predict:*** How much would a 10-mile ride cost?

<div role="img" aria-label="Three ride cards: &#36;11.00 for 4 miles, &#36;15.00 for 6 miles, and &#36;19.00 for 8 miles" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;">
  <div style="background: #FAFAFC; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; width: 200px;">
    <div style="display: inline-block; background: #4C42CF; color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 10px;">&#128663; RIDE</div>
    <div style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a;">&#36;11.00</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 8px;">&#8226; &#8226; &#8226; 4 miles &#8226; &#8226; &#8226;</div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #FAFAFC; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; width: 200px;">
    <div style="display: inline-block; background: #4C42CF; color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 10px;">&#128663; RIDE</div>
    <div style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a;">&#36;15.00</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 8px;">&#8226; &#8226; &#8226; 6 miles &#8226; &#8226; &#8226;</div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #FAFAFC; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; width: 200px;">
    <div style="display: inline-block; background: #4C42CF; color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 10px;">&#128663; RIDE</div>
    <div style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a;">&#36;19.00</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 8px;">&#8226; &#8226; &#8226; 8 miles &#8226; &#8226; &#8226;</div>
